The Science of Glimmers and Gratitude
Featuring Adriene Mishler + Dr. Mary Helen Immordino-Yang

Glimmers are those tiny moments that remind your body: you’re safe. A soft breath. A warm presence. A moment of connection that shifts everything.

This short film explores the everyday science of glimmers and the power of gratitude — and what happens when we actually slow down enough to notice them.

A grounding, gentle reset for anyone feeling stretched thin.

